Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.83,0:00:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  各位听好  明天是艾蜜莉再婚的日子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, guys, listen, don't forget that tomorrow is the day that Emily gets married again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要尽全力  转移罗斯的注意力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so whatever we do, just try to really keep Ross's mind off of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  好主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, man. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在想艾蜜莉明天结婚的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, eh, Just thinking about Emily getting married tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Ross. Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看什么  在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在那儿啊  快看  快看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right over there. There. Look, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我看什么  谁来帮帮我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I looking at? Somebody help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  抱歉我昨晚没过去  我跟盖瑞在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, sorry I didn't come by last night. I was out with Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他用警车载我去兜风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He let me ride around with him in his cop car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还阻止了一起犯罪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We saw and prevented crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.08,0:00:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以坐警车去兜风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got to go on a ride-along? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要坐警车兜风\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to go on a ride-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  我也要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Okay. Yeah. Yeah, yeah! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你也要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:01:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点危险喔  我喜欢危险\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's kind of dangerous. Well, I like danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你们今天晚上有空吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you guys free tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚  你刚才没说是在晚上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tonight? You-you didn't say it was going to be at nighttime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第20集  一起去巡逻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E20  The One With The Ride Along
