Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地  终于要整理了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thank God. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经把照片分门别类\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I've broken them down into categories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有假日类  生日和偷拍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We got holidays, birthdays, candids...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经依照主题  做好了交叉搜寻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then what I've done is I've cross-referenced them by subject. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.13,0:02:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好比你要找生日和狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if you're looking up, oh let's say birthdays and dogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会找到152号相片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you get photo 152.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  是我和拉普\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's me and LePoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真怀念那条狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I miss that dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也能在狗和死亡项目之中  找到他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can also find him under umm, dog and dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  多谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把另一箱照片递给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Hand me that other box of photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是最后一箱  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that's the very last one. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好你有写上号码  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, good thing you number all of them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没  152号相片是范例\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hadn't. Photo 152 was a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  没关系的  我帮你弄杯喝的  玛格莉特好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohhhh. Honey, honey, honey, it's okay, it's okay honey. I'm gonna fix you a drink, huh? Maybe a margarita?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.69,0:03:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果汁机在罗斯那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross has the blender.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都毁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everything's just falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  不碍事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No honey, it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.73,0:03:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去找罗斯拿果汁机  你先准备玛格莉特的材料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I'll got to Ross's and get the blender, you get all the margarita stuff ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  他家钥匙放在抽屉里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, he's keys are in the drawer. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还需要一些现金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? I also need some cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我去自动柜员机领吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you want me to stop at the ATM?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用  到罗斯家里拿就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nah, while you're at Ross's if you see any lying around¡­
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我不做那种事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?! I-I-I don't, I don't do that! 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你逼问那家伙的方式  真是太酷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was so cool, man. The way you leaned on that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天色越来越黑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is starting to get dark out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他什么都招了  他对你毫不保留\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He told you everything. I mean you totally cracked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  他是受害者  他们通常话都很多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah well, being that he was the victim, they're usually pretty talkative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  正式进入夜晚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but it is officially nighttime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖瑞  要我帮你拿红灯吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh hey, Gary, want me to grab the berry for ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这叫做警灯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's called the cherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} It's the—Chandler!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,买到了  这家店做的三明治  世界第一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I got it! This place makes the best sandwich in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  里头有肉球吗  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Joe does it have meatballs on it? Oh-ho, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有融化的起司和大蒜蕃茄酱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does it have melted cheese and marinara sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  那就不能在我的车上吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you can't eat that in my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,买这部警车的钱   我缴的税也有一份\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Even though my tax dollars paid for this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你缴的税\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your tax dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  你的钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个三明治还真香\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! That sandwich really does smell good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有说你可以闻吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did I say you could smell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闻个三明治都不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't smell your sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,香味就占去了好吃的一半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Half the taste is in the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把好吃的都吸光了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You-you're sucking up all the tastiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:04:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  还给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll give them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这三明治到底棒在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look! What is so great about that sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想像你做爱最爽的一次  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Imagine the best sex you ever had. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想的是摩妮卡吗  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you thinking about Monica? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  是什么感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, what's that like?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  不要是真的恐龙  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh please don't be from a real dinosaur. Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  千万不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"墨西哥制造"  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Made in Mexico." Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会买这种东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who would buy this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  是我  快接啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, it's me. Pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做玛格莉特还缺材料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need a few more things to make the margaritas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:06:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要盐  玛格莉特调汁  还有龙舌兰酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uhh, I need some salt, some margarita mix, and tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们家里只有冰块啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So all we have is ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看他有没有冰块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See if he has ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  罗斯  我是艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello Ross? It's Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很突然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know this is out of the blue
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我明天就要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but uh, I'm getting married tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许啦  我一直在想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe I am. I keep thinking about you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道我们匆忙地放弃对方  是不是一个错误\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I'm wondering if-if we made a mistake giving up so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有在想我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you thinking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有的话  今晚打给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if you are, call me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下一站是哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So where are we going next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个目击证人不回我电话  我们去他家堵他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This witness won't return my calls so we're gonna see if we can surprise him coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去堵他  他不会生气吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Surprise him? We're not gonna make anybody mad, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你会在那贼人的律师出现前  先从他身上挤出一些汁来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen so uh, are you gonna squeeze the perps shoes a little bit before he lawyers up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是目击证人  不是贼人  而且没有人会那样说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's a witness, not a perp. And no one talks like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没人会那样说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. No one talks like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你是警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what, like you're Mr. Cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我比你们两个都像警察\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm more cop than you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you figure that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒吧  我坐在前座\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello! I'm in the front seat,  okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是盖瑞的搭档\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm Gary's partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说搭档的时候不像警察  倒像是同志\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, When you say "partner," it doesn't sound cop.It sounds gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱吃醋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦  别张扬  我们这是秘密出勤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, do you mind? We're under cover here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. No problem
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross. Sorry. Sorry! Oh, 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖瑞  我是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Gary. Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phone home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这位罗斯警官  被打入后座了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at Officer Ross riding back here with the visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  这是怎么一回事呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, What's up with that, Serpico?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有在想我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you thinking about me?.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, of course you're not
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有的话  今晚打给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if you are, call me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好先被你听到了  我们一定要把这留言洗掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well thank God you were here!  We have to erase that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我们不能那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非这样不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一罗斯听到了  回电给她  他们又会合了怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}what if Ross's hears that and then calls her back and then they get back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你希望那样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到罗斯跟那个控制欲超强  神经兮兮的疯子艾蜜莉复合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross back with that controlling, neurotic, crazy Emily?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个不让罗斯见你的艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The Emily that wouldn't let him see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  万万不可\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Oh, no, no.God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能和她复合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He should not get back with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知  我知  就连罗斯都知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know that, you know that. Even Ross knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还是没有权力  擅自洗掉给罗斯的留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that still doesn’t give us the right to erase his message!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是他的妹妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm his sister. okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱他  不想看他受到伤害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I love him. I don't want to see him get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了  我这样还没有权控制\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on! Doesn't that give me the right to control him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得需要帮忙的不是他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think he's the one who needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉非常不稳定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, look, she's obviously unstable, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她竟然想在结婚当天落跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean she's thinking about running out on her wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  但你看看  她让罗斯陷入了什么处境\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, fine! But I mean, look at the position she's putting him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要罗斯怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道让罗斯在艾蜜莉结婚当天  跑去破坏婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross is gonna run over there on the wedding day and break up the marriage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁做得出那种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, who would do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  不过这是两码子事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, fine. All right. but that's y'know, it's different! 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有很多人都是重复的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Although it did involve a lot of the same people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.03,0:09:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾蜜莉显然想用变态的笑话  来恶整罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what, this is obviously some kind of twisted joke she's trying to play on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  你疯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you are crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她听起来真的很沮丧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, but she sounded generally upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.45,0:09:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听听就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您的留官已经删除\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your messages have been erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Noooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们很安全  对吧  不可能会有厄运降临\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, y'know, we-we're safe right? I mean nothing bad can go down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  不过我倒想起来了  签一下这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. But that reminds me. Sign this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:09:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  只是断腿或脑袋开花  也不能告到市政府头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh it's nothing, it just says that you can't sue the city if you scrap your knee or y'know, get your head blown off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点喔  我要签\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hurry up. I want to sign that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  他来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在干嘛  搞什么鬼啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is he doing? What the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What? What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧  发生什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is everything okay? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看到我们了  别动  不要看他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, he sees us. Now don't move. Don't look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  只是车子熄火了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, it's okay. It was just a car backfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看  你想用身体掩护朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look at that. You tried to save your buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.43,0:10:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到没有  他冒死拯救朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see that? You see what he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Thanks, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh... Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I guess we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, wait. wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我们得补救这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, we have to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们无能为力啊  你已经把留言删掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's nothing we can do. You erased the message!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以老实跟他说啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah well unless we tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想要这么明理的话  我也争不过你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you're gonna be totally rational about this, I can't argue with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  你要说就说  我不想介入\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right? Fine, if you wanna tell him, tell him. I just don't want to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许又是艾蜜莉打来的  她想说一样的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, maybe that's Emily calling back to leave the exact same message.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯  是你啊  我只是要你记得这种感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Ross! It's you! I just want you to remember this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活着是一种幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以每一天都要活得精彩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So live every day to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍爱自己  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Love yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  也别忘了买邮票  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and also get stamps. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  只要把这留言放给艾蜜莉听  所有的问题就都解决了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow! Play that message for Emily, and this problem goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁要来见见英雄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, anybody want to meet a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰葛林来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}John Glenn is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  今晚真是太不可思议了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, We had the most incredible night. Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在警车里   慢着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so, we're in the car... Wait. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  继续说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们在警车里  \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, So we're in the car, Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突然"砰"一声  有人开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And bang! A shot was fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊完全不顾自己的安危  扑到我身上保护我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Joey with no regard for his own safety throws himself on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是汽车熄火放屁的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was a car backfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是当时他并不知道  对  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, But he didn't know that.Yeah, I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那很有可能是子弹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it could've just as easily have been a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  有没有想过要当警察   警界很需要你这种人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Joe, you ever think about joining the force? We could use a guy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到巨响就吓得跳起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who jumps at loud noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚有可能丧命的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. I could have died tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  如果那部放屁的车  把你碾过去的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! If the car that backfired had run over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:13:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先回家去了  省得罗斯大谈人生新发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I'll go home before Ross starts rambling about his newfound respect for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人生的确有了新发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do have a newfound respect for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃晚餐吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you wanna get some dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  若现在听到枪声  我一定会扑倒你身上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, y'know what? If I heard a shot right now, I'd throw my body on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  那我们或许应该  去穷山恶极的社区散步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah? Well maybe you and I should take a walk through a bad neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你别再闹了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cut it out Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想在同一天里  先是救你然后又痛扁你一顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hate to have to save your life and kick your ass in the same day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才怎么先闪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How come you took off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是去散步  在客厅里绕来绕去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I just went for a walk, around the living room. Whatever¡­
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不对吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我只是累了  走路走累了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, I'm just tired.Y'know, from-from the walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你扑上去救罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You dove in front of Ross! Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么一回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你恨罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. You hate Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有恨罗斯  你当然有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't hate Ross. Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我救了他  你生我的气  这样全都说得通了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saved him. You're mad at me. It all adds up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想铲除罗斯  铲除什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want Ross out of the picture. What picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.69,0:14:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  但是你说的话很吓人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. But I don't like what I'm hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你在汽车放屁事件中  救了罗斯一命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look I'm very glad that you saved Ross from the car backfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那如果真的是子弹怎么办  你竟然救他不救我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but y'know, it could've been a bullet and you y'know, you didn't try to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.25,0:14:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你是在气这个  你以为我觉得罗斯比你重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, you're upset because you think I chose Ross over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的   我知道你能照顾自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I knew you could take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯需要别人帮忙  他不像你我见过大场面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? I mean, Ross needs help. He's not "street" like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话说到头  你宁愿先去救罗斯  也不来救我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When it comes down to it, you would risk your life for Ross before you would for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是重点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不完全是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, no, not exactly! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:15:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我那不是要救罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, look, I, I wasn't trying to save Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的三明治在罗斯旁边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My sandwich was next to Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是要救我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was, I was trying to save my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怕它被枪打到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From a bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这么说  像是没啥道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it doesn't make much sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,岂止没啥道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Much" sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  那是本能反应  我就扑过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look Chandler, it was instinct. Okay? I just went for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你冒死  去救三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you risked your life, for a sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这听起来很夸张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know it sounds crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  钱德  这可是世界上最棒的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but Chandler this is the greatest sandwich in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你并不觉得罗斯比我重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you didn't uh, choose Ross before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才不  我绝对不会那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就像是我的亲兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  对  为了证明你对我的意义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?  Yeah. In fact, to prove how much you mean to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  轻点啊  这不是热狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. No, eh, oh-oi, easy, it's not a hot dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是很好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How good is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  你在干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh-whoa-hey, dude, What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要证明我对你的意义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you were showing me how much you mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  用一口来证明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. With a bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也帮帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gee-e-e-eez!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你在这里干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, what uh, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动不动就往我们公寓跑  我这只是小巫见大巫而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you know what? You are in our apartment all the time.Okay? This is, this is just a drop in the bucket mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系啦  重点是你来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It doesn't matter. The important thing is that you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:17:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我朋友  而你来到了这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're my friend and you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我有一点点害怕  罗斯  你是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, just a little scared. What's going on Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚发生了最不寻常的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The most amazing thing happened tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为自己要去见阎王了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought my number was up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真正面临到了濒死的经历\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had an actual near-death experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么  怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?! What? What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们不是跟盖瑞坐警车兜风吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, we were on the ride along with Gary, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人朝着我开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and somebody took a shot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  是车子放屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. A car backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我当时以为是有人对我开枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I thought somebody was taking a shot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我劫后余生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, Rach...I survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的人生拥有了全新视野\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I was filled with this great respect for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要真切体验每一刻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know? I-I want to experience every moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把握每一个机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to seize every opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的一切都变得好清晰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I-I am seeing everything so-so clearly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都是因为汽车放屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because a car backfired?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:17:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你来这里干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这件事符不符合  你所谓的〝把握每一个机会〞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I-I-I don't know how this fits into your whole "seizing" thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过艾蜜莉今天打电话给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but Emily called you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟她说了话  没有  她在你电话里留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You talked to her? No, She left a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过留言被删掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it kind of got erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你的答录机有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean,  There's just ... something wrong with your machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她说了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, okay, what-what did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么对结婚的事有点反悔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,something about having second thoughts about the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说你们分手是个错误\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And did you guys make a mistake breaking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.39,0:18:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要你回电\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she wants you to call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我跟你说这件事很对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, that-that was a good thing that I told you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  当然是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yes. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去跟摩妮卡说  我这样做是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because...I'm gonna tell Monica I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你知道吗  她不希望  那不重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because y'know what?  she didn't want...Not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重点是  我是对的  你自己决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Point is, I was right. Your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我是对的  你自己决定要不要回电\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? I was right. Your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜我应该回电给艾蜜莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I should call Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对  你的决定不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's not the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你清醒一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not right. Ross, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人把你给整惨了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, that woman made you miserable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.85,0:19:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你真的想要再来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Ross? Do you really want to get back into that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.07,0:19:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她是在昨天打来的  我压根不会想回电\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look. Yesterday...I wouldn't have even considered calling her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在我面对濒死经历的同一天  我的前妻正好打电话来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But my ex-wife calls on the same day...I have a near-death experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一定有所含意吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, that-that has got to mean something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  那不是濒死经历  就连经验都谈不上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was not a near-death experience. That was barely an experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时你并不在场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You weren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这就是我应该把握的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Okay, Maybe this is something that I'm supposed to seize, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这无关把握或是不把握\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe this is not about seizing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这是关于逃避\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe this is about escaping stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就拿今天来说  你逃过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Look at today.I mean, you escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这是你逃避的机会  不去和艾蜜莉复合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know? And maybe this is a chance for you to escape getting back together with Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还蛮有道理的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我要把握住这个机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I do want to seize some opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我真的不想她见面或联络\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I really don't want to see or talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不就结了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许今天只是〝千钧一发〞日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, maybe today's just close-call day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, thanks, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  甭客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, honey. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   留言灯在闪呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh wait-wait-wait! The message is blinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许留言没被删掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you didn't erase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.40,0:20:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  是你啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross, it's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是旧的留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh yeah, no that's-that's an old message,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么好听的  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody needs to hear that. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡有来过吗  有啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, um, was Monica here? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要她把我的钱还来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want my money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是要用来买邮票的吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, uh You probably need that for stamps, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  盖瑞有真的中枪过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs? Has Gary ever been shot at for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小小的一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, a little. 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是他自己打的  这故事没什么好讲的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He kind of did it to himself. It's not really a good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道我置身战火会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wonder how I'd react under fire.y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是汽车放屁  是枪林弹雨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And not backfire...but-but heavy fire, 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好比我在战场上之类的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}like I was in a war or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去打仗一定很厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I would be great in a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会是很棒的军事领袖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I really, I think I'd make a fantastic military leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你们这些人比起来  我一定会最先当上将军\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I know I'd make general before any of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你被自己的部下枪杀前还是之后啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Before or after you were shot by your own troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道乔伊会在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know where Joey would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会在散兵坑里保护大家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He would be down in the foxhole protecting all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  如果那个散兵坑  是用三明治围起来的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, if the foxhole was lined with sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  英雄三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, hero sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我主张和平  我对什么战争都没兴趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well you all know I'm a pacifist, so I'm not interested in war in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过等到革命的那一天来临  我一定要把你们消灭光光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But y'know what? when the revolution comes, I'll have to destroy you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你例外\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not you, Joey.
